{
  "_comment": [
    "Example `<workdir>/crustify/campaigns/<campaign-id>/schedule.json`.",
    "The campaign's total execution order, emitted once before the first",
    "agent starts. Waves run in array order; the batches within one wave run",
    "in parallel. A batch entry is exactly the object `crustify translate`",
    "accepts, so writing it out to batch-<index>.json is a copy.",
    "Every path is derived from (campaign, link_unit, subsystem, index).",
    "Raw-lifetime discovery runs first and has no subsystem of its own."
